        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "12 Cherryfield View, Cherryfield, Clonsilla, Dublin 15, D15 W3FX  Asking Price: €400,000  12 Cherryfield View is a spacious and well-presented three-bedroom family home ideally located within this mature and highly sought-after residential development in the heart of Clonsilla. Offering generous accommodation throughout, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families, and investors alike.  The accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room, and a fully fitted kitchen/dining area with access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with en-suite facilities. The property benefits from three bathrooms in total, comprising a guest WC, family bathroom, and en-suite, providing excellent convenience for modern family living.  Outside, the property enjoys off-street parking to the front and a private rear garden, offering an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining, or family activities.  Cherryfield is a well-established and family-friendly development situated close to a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops, parks, sporting facilities, and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with Clonsilla Train Station and numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby, while the N3 and M50 provide excellent access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.  Key Features: • Spacious three-bedroom family home • Three bathrooms (guest WC, family bathroom, and en-suite) • Bright and well-proportioned accommodation • Private rear garden • Off-street parking • BER D1 • Mature and sought-after residential location • Close to schools, shops, transport links, and Blanchardstown Centre • Easy access to the N3, M50, and Dublin Airport  A wonderful opportunity to acquire a quality family home in a convenient and established Dublin 15 location. Early viewing is highly recommended."
